 performance, and interoperability tests, ensuring our solutions meet customer requirements.\n   \n\n  \n\n**How You Will Contribute And What You Will Learn**\n* Design and maintain full\\-stack service labs, integrating applications, networks, and cloud platforms.\n* Ensure vertical and horizontal integration across diverse cloud platforms and applications.\n* Lead the execution of end\\-to\\-end test setups, matching NAM customer architectures and gold standards.\n* Deploy and maintain automation infrastructure, including pipelines, tools, and scripts.\n* Build and manage shared cloud lab environments, providing on\\-demand access to domains.\n* Keep labs stable, secure, and user\\-friendly, ensuring optimal performance and security.\n* Automate lab creation, teardown, and maintenance processes, reducing manual effort.\n* Utilize scripts, pipelines, and APIs to minimize manual work and enhance efficiency.\n* Lead the development of test scripts for automated testing, improving test coverage and speed.\n* Track test progress, resolve issues, and validate results against requirements, delivering comprehensive validation reports.\n\n\n**Key Skills And Experience**\n Must have:\n   \n\n  \n\n* Bachelor's degree in computer science, Engineering, or a related field.\n* 5\\+ years of experience in software development, cloud computing, or a similar field.\n* Knowledge of K8s and openstack cloud platforms, networking, and Nokia Core and BA application integration.\n* Experience with Nokia automation tools, pipelines, and scripting languages.\n* Proficiency in designing and implementing end\\-to\\-end test strategies.\n* Excellent problem\\-solving and analytical skills, with a focus on attention to detail.\n* Ability to work independently and manage multiple projects simultaneously.\n\n\n Good to have:\n   \n\n  \n\n* Effective communication skills, both written and verbal, for collaborating with cross\\-functional teams.\n* Willingness to learn and adapt to new technologies and industry trends.\n* A proactive and innovative mindset, driving continuous improvement.\n\n\n**About Us**\n**Advancing connectivity to secure a brighter world.**\n Nokia is a global leader in connectivity for the AI era. With expertise across fixed, mobile and transport networks, powered by the innovation of Nokia Bell Labs, we\u2019re advancing connectivity to secure a brighter world.\n   \n\n  \n\n Learn more about life at Nokia .\n   \n\n  \n\n**Our recruitment process**\n We act inclusively and respect the uniqueness of people. Our employment decisions are made regardless of race, color, national or ethnic origin, religion, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, age, marital status, disability, protected veteran status or other characteristics protected by law. We are committed to a culture of inclusion built upon our core value of respect.\n   \n\n  \n\n If you\u2019re interested in this role but don\u2019t meet every listed requirement, we still encourage you to apply. Unique backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences enrich our teams, and you may be just the right candidate for this or another opportunity.\n   \n\n  \n\n The length of the recruitment process may vary depending on the specific role's requirements. We strive to ensure a smooth and inclusive experience for all candidates. Discover more about the recruitment process at Nokia ."},{"title":"AWS Architect / Associate Director (Noida)","company":"Ydts Global","location":"Noida","date_posted":"2026-08-21","url":"https://www.shine.com/jobs/aws-architect-associate-director-noida/ydts-global/19486274","experience":"5 to 9 Yrs","skills":[1,14,15,18,20,30,34,102]},{"title":"Seeking Content Management System (Adobe AEM) and Cloud (AWS) System / Web","company":"Good People HR Pty Ltd","location":"Noida","date_posted":"2026-08-11","url":"https://www.shine.com/jobs/seeking-content-management-system-adobe-aem-and-cloud-aws-system-web/good-people-hr-pty-ltd/19443172","experience":"2 t